@startuml uc04-consultar-extrato
!include _style.puml
title UC04 · Consultar Extrato (Professor e Aluno)
footer StudentPay · Release 2 · Lab04S01 — Diagrama de Sequência
autonumber "<b>00"

actor "Usuário\n(Professor · Aluno)" as U
participant "React SPA\n(Dashboard)" as SPA COR_SPA

box "Quarkus · Backend (MVC)"
    participant "Professor/Vantagem\nController «control»" as CTRL COR_CONTROLLER
    participant "Professor/Vantagem\nService «service»" as SVC COR_SERVICE
    participant "Carteira/Transacao\nRepository «repository»" as REPO COR_REPO
end box

database "PostgreSQL" as DB COR_DB

note over U, CTRL : Pré-condição «include» UC03 — requisição autenticada (Bearer JWT)

U -> SPA : Acessa o painel / aba Extrato
SPA -> CTRL : GET /api/{professores|vantagens}/extrato\nAuthorization: Bearer <jwt>
activate CTRL
CTRL -> CTRL : @RolesAllowed valida tipo no token\nuserId = jwt.getClaim("userId")
CTRL -> SVC : consultarExtrato(userId)
activate SVC
SVC -> REPO : carteira.findByUsuarioId(userId)
REPO -> DB : SELECT carteira WHERE usuario_id = ?
DB --> REPO
REPO --> SVC
SVC -> REPO : transacoes.findByCarteiraId(carteiraId)
REPO -> DB : SELECT transacoes ORDER BY data_hora DESC
DB --> REPO
REPO --> SVC
SVC -> SVC : Monta ExtratoResponse\n(saldoAtual + List<TransacaoDTO>)
note right of SVC
    Polimorfismo de TransacaoMoeda:
    ENVIO → contraparte = remetente/destinatário
    RESGATE → contraparte = vantagem
    CREDITO_SEMESTRAL → "crédito do sistema"
end note
SVC --> CTRL : ExtratoResponse
deactivate SVC
CTRL --> SPA : 200 OK { saldoAtual, transacoes[] }
deactivate CTRL
SPA --> U : Renderiza saldo (StatCard) e extrato (ExtratoTable)

@enduml
